<GuideLayout
  title="Dry Creek Bed Construction Guide - Channel Sizing & Stone Placement"
  metaDescription="Civil and landscape guide to dry creek bed construction. Channel parabolic sizing, multi-tier river rock and riprap layering, and stormwater dissipation."
  canonicalPath="/dry-creek-bed"
  guideTitle="Dry Creek Bed Guide: Channel Sizing & Stone Placement"
  guideSubtitle="A stormwater engineering and landscape design manual. Control heavy surface runoff, prevent bank erosion, and create a naturalized dry stream bed."
